        <div class="import-header">
            <h1>CSV Import Failed</h1>
        </div>
        <p>Your CSV file could not be imported successfully.</p>
        <div class="import-summary">
            <h2>Import Summary</h2>
            <p><b>File Name: </b>{{fileName}}</p>
            <p><b>Total Tasks: </b>{{totalTasks}}</b></p>
            <p><b>Failed Tasks: </b>{{failedImports}}</p>
            <br>
            <h2>Failed Task Details</h2>
            <p>{{errorMessages}}</p>
        </div>
        <p><b>Project:</b> <a href="{{projectUrl}}" class="project-link">Project Detail</a></p>
        <p><b>Tasks:</b> <a href="{{tasksUrl}}" class="tasks-link">Project Task Management</a></p>
        <p>The import process has been completed successfully.</p>
        <br>
        <div>
            Thank you,<br>
            <b>JIPA Project Task List Mass Import Team </b>
        </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>